Privacy Policy
📅 Last updated: May 2026 📍 Fresno County, CA 🌐 five59inehub.com
🌻
The short version: We collect as little as possible, never sell your data, never display ads, and never share your information with third parties for any reason. Your privacy is not a product here.
🗂️ What We Collect ANONYMOUS USAGE DATA
We use Google Analytics to understand how the Site is used — which categories are most visited, what terms are searched, device types, and general geographic region (city-level only; never your exact location or IP-based identity). This data is aggregated, anonymous, and used solely to improve the Site.
OPTIONAL ACCOUNT INFORMATION
If you choose to create a free account, we store the name, email, ZIP code, and notification preferences you provide. This information is used exclusively to personalize your experience (saved resources, custom greeting, push alerts). Creating an account is never required to use any feature of this Site.
CONTACT FORM SUBMISSIONS
When you use our Feedback, Partnership, or Newsletter forms, the information you submit is sent to our administrative email inbox so we can respond to you. We do not add you to any mailing list without your explicit consent.
🚫 What We Never Do
✅ WE DO
✅
Provide free, anonymous access to all resources
✅
Use Google Analytics for anonymous traffic data
✅
Store account info securely for your benefit only
✅
Honor deletion requests promptly
✅
Respect your right to opt out of anything
🚫 WE NEVER DO
🚫
Sell, rent, or trade your personal data
