⚖️ Your Rights — California (CCPA)
As a California resident, you have specific rights under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA):
👁️
Right to Know
Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you.
🗑️
Right to Delete
Request deletion of any personal information we've collected.
🚫
Right to Opt Out
We don't sell your data, so this right is automatically honored.
🛡️
Non-Discrimination
Exercising your rights never affects your access to this Site.
To exercise any of these rights, email us at fresnoresourcehub@mailfence.com. We respond within 48 hours and process all requests within 45 days as required by law.
🔗 Third-Party Links & Children's Privacy
Third-Party Links: This Site links to external organizations, Cash App, Venmo, and Google services. Once you leave our Site, their respective privacy policies govern your data. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of any linked third party.
Children's Privacy: This Site is intended for general audiences. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us information, contact us immediately for prompt removal.
Special Populations: Domestic violence survivors, undocumented residents, and people in crisis can browse this Site without creating an account, providing ID, or leaving any identifiable footprint. Browse safely.
